{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not silently accept failed MDC restoration.** With a direct executor, ordinary restoration failures are ignored after the result is settled, so the invocation succeeds while the reused worker may retain corrupted or leaked MDC. Restore through a safe fallback, or complete exceptionally for retry before publishing the result; assert the worker's complete MDC map afterward.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77L0g6","finding_digest":"51b3110768aa57a025405e5f29773d4785c5995e5de3fc606cd430926b507f01","finding_id":"arf_v1_kgzrcb3ivjl2ajkalzpss5z5i6","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::inline-mdc-restoration-leak","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::inline-mdc-restoration-leak","line":284,"observation_digest":"590b0f34adc059f8c01859b35f7a382d7389ef1822a1b9e4fc6836254f44d3f7","observation_id":"aro_v1_lefq6nfnybm7rqaylgzv66ryfv","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_kgzrcb3ivjl2ajkalzpss5z5i6","published_at":"2026-10-08T03:06:55Z","review_id":"arr_v1_c2usoqym5ckwbtcjab5hzdhwpt","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"4cc0f356ca4356dd098c503ca66555819d92391f","reviewer":"codex","start_line":281,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_7ddyq3qjtx2neywk4ufca4cnhx","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T03:06:55Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
